//     International Journal of Fuels and Lubricants, 12(3), 155-166: the
//     30, 45 and 60 degree included crosshatch angles.
//   EngineLabs. Honing at home: 45 degrees included, 22.5 on the angle
//     card. https://www.enginelabs.com/?p=6118
