//     0.5 of the tool's width.
//     https://industrialmonitordirect.com/blogs/knowledgebase/engine-turning-metal-jeweling-process-guide
//   VDI 3400. Electrical discharge machining: surface texture grades, Ra 0.4
//     um at VDI 12 to 18 um at VDI 45, with K = 20 log(10 Ra). EDM Today,
//     Fall 2024, p. 12,
//     https://www.edmtodaymagazine.com/main_archive/Fall_2024/files/basic-html/page12.html
//     and the grade chart at
//     https://hlhrapid.com/knowledge/injection-molding-vdi-surface-finish/
